  "display_title": "The Holy Power of Modern Medicine",
  "description": "Jin Yoo-Sung was a gifted surgeon said to be able to bring the dead back to life. However, not even this genius doctor had the ability to revive himself. Following a fatal car crash, Yoo-Sung closed his eyes for what he'd thought was the last time… only to wake up and find that he's been reborn in a fantasy world! A doctor through and through, Yoo-Sung—now Ray—resolves to become a healer again. Unfortunately, it seems his new magical abilities may not be the most fitting for his dream career… \n\n(Source: Tapas, edited)",
